expect step 7
read Filter house notice
expect step 8
open Patrol van's lockbox
wait 3
expect step 9
zone sludge_beds
expect step 10
# DEEP 10-24: the notice, the climb, the dive, the test-pump lever
expect hidden pc_rewchest
use pc_machine
expect hidden pc_rewchest
read Waterworks notice
expect step 11
zone pc_trail
expect step 12
openat -40.2 -18.9
zone pc_summit
expect step 13
expect stand -37.9 -8.93 h=38
open Old water tower deck box
